The SVG brand marks in index.tsx (openai, anthropic, google, deepseek, meta,
mistral, qwen) are the plain (single-path, non-color) marks from Lobe Icons
(https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons/tree/master/packages/static-svg/icons),
copied verbatim with no changes to their path geometry, so they can be tinted
to any theme color via `fill="currentColor"`. Same source as the rasterized
PNGs in src/norefund/assets/icons/providers.

Lobe Icons is distributed under the MIT License, reproduced in full below.
These are third-party trademarks of their respective owners (OpenAI,
Anthropic, Google, DeepSeek, Meta, Mistral AI, Alibaba Cloud/Qwen); their use
here is solely to identify each provider in the model list, not to imply
endorsement.

